      "description": "Generate a REAL marketing image, save it to the existing Gallery with its visual direction, and attach it to a draft post. Pass post_id plus prompt, aspect_ratio (4:5, 1:1 or 9:16) and a structured visual_direction (visual_type, creative_concept, content_objective, subject, setting, composition, camera_angle, framing, lighting, mood, color_direction, materials, textures, movement, text_overlay, typography_direction, safe_area_requirements, reference_assets, elements_to_preserve, elements_to_avoid, reason_for_match). Prefer real app screenshots and UI mockups. Optional: campaign_id, portfolio_item_id, text_overlay, reference_asset_urls, original_request, regenerate + variation_instruction. Returns ok, media_id, image_url, post_id, aspect_ratio and the previous version. Never approves, schedules or publishes."
